-No, that's my job.

00:05:31.901 --> 00:05:34.434
-Because I feel weird.
-No, no.

00:05:34.434 --> 00:05:36.267
-Then I'll go down
a rabbit hole.

00:05:36.267 --> 00:05:37.834
-No. It's well done.
You've got that.

00:05:37.834 --> 00:05:40.133
Can we set up your character
at all?

00:05:40.133 --> 00:05:41.434
-Yeah, Birdie Jay --

00:05:41.434 --> 00:05:42.901
which was actually --
It's my nickname.

00:05:42.901 --> 00:05:45.200
So, my dad, Kurt, has called me
Birdie my whole life.

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:47.234
It was sort of --
Immediately when I read it,

00:05:47.234 --> 00:05:48.901
