"Oh, Birdie. That's easy."

00:05:48.901 --> 00:05:51.167
-That's weird.
-That feels good.

00:05:51.167 --> 00:05:53.667
But Birdie Jay
is not a lot like me.

00:05:53.667 --> 00:05:55.601
I mean, she says things
that she shouldn't.

00:05:55.601 --> 00:05:57.167
-Yeah.
-She's very uncensored.

00:05:57.167 --> 00:06:00.601
-Yeah.
-Um, she's bold, flamboy--

00:06:00.601 --> 00:06:02.400
-What does she do for a living?

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:06.567
-She -- I mean,
she has a sweatpants company.

00:06:06.567 --> 00:06:07.801
-Mm-hmm.

00:06:07.801 --> 00:06:09.067
[ Laughter ]

00:06:09.067 --> 00:06:11.968
-And -- [ Laughs ]
-Okay.

00:06:11.968 --> 00:06:14.801
-And she is like a --

00:06:14.801 --> 00:06:17.934
kind of was a model-ish...
-Yep. Okay.

00:06:17.934 --> 00:06:19.767
-...socialite vibes.

00:06:19.767 --> 00:06:21.033
-Okay.
-Right?

00:06:21.033 --> 00:06:23.133
Yeah. One of those.
-Yep.

00:06:23.133 --> 00:06:27.501
-And she -- Miles Bron,
Edward Norton.

00:06:27.501 --> 00:06:29.033
He plays the billionaire.

00:06:29.033 --> 00:06:30.634
We're all going to his island,

00:06:30.634 --> 00:06:32.901
and we're all kind of
connected to Miles

00:06:32.901 --> 00:06:35.734
